config OPLUS_FEATURE_GAME_OPT
	bool "Oplus game optimization telemetry and frequency controls"
	depends on CPU_FREQ && CPU_IDLE && PROC_FS
	default n
	help
	  Build the /proc/game_opt telemetry used by the ColorOS 14 GameOpt
	  service.  CPU load is sampled continuously; per-task runtime and
	  render-waker accounting remain dormant until userspace selects their
	  target processes.  CPU minimum and maximum frequency requests use the
	  kernel's existing cpufreq policy-notifier path and impose no limit
	  until userspace writes them.  Unrelated scheduler policy is excluded.
